{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c7241852-6428-48b2-8422-9214cd918342",
    "name": "AWS Architecture Quest - Hints & Evaluation Module",
    "description": "Colección de pruebas para el Módulo de Pistas y Evaluación (Fase 3 - Hito 3.4).\n\nCubre todos los endpoints de pistas, motor de evaluación en memoria, cálculo de XP anti-farmeo y auditoría de intentos según specs/hints-evaluation-module-spec.md y docs/08-api-spec.md:\n- POST /api/v1/auth/guest (Setup de sesión)\n- GET /api/v1/units (Obtención de ID de desafío dinámico)\n- POST /api/v1/challenges/{id}/hints/unlock (Desbloqueo secuencial de pistas y acumulación de penalización)\n- POST /api/v1/challenges/{id}/evaluate (Evaluación de arquitectura, cálculo de XP y actualización de nivel)\n- GET /api/v1/challenges/{id}/attempts (Historial de envíos del usuario)\n- Escenarios de error (401 Unauthorized, 404 Challenge Not Found, 400 Bad Request / All hints unlocked)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://localhost:7234",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "authToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "challengeId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Setup de Autenticación y Desafío",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Obtener Sesión para Pruebas (/auth/guest)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code es 201 Created\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Guarda token JWT de sesión\", function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true;",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.accessToken).to.be.a(\"string\");",
                  "    ",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"authToken\", json.data.accessToken);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": ""
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/guest",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "auth",
                "guest"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Obtiene un token JWT de sesión de invitado para autenticar las peticiones de pistas y evaluación."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Obtener Primer Desafío del Catálogo (/units)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code es 200 OK\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Extrae y almacena un challengeId válido\", function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true;",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.be.an(\"array\").that.is.not.empty;",
                  "    ",
                  "    var firstUnit = json.data[0];",
                  "    pm.expect(firstUnit.challenges).to.be.an(\"array\").that.is.not.empty;",
                  "    ",
                  "    var firstChallenge = firstUnit.challenges[0];",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"challengeId\", firstChallenge.id);",
                  "    console.log(\"ChallengeId seleccionado para pruebas:\", firstChallenge.id);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{authToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/units",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "units"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Consulta el catálogo para extraer dinámicamente un challengeId existente para las pruebas posteriores."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 - Desbloqueo Secuencial de Pistas (/hints/unlock)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Desbloquear Siguiente Pista - Pista 1",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code es 200 OK\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Valida estructura de respuesta de pista desbloqueada\", function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true;",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property(\"unlockedHint\");",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.unlockedHint).to.have.property(\"orderIndex\", 1);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.unlockedHint.text).to.be.a(\"string\").that.is.not.empty;",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.unlockedHint.penaltyApplied).to.be.a(\"number\");",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.totalHintsUnlocked).to.eql(1);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.totalPenaltyAccumulated).to.be.at.least(0);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{authToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/challenges/{{challengeId}}/hints/unlock",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "challenges",
                "{{challengeId}}",
                "hints",
                "unlock"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Desbloquea la primera pista del desafío seleccionado y aplica la penalización acumulativa."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Desbloquear Siguiente Pista - Pista 2",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code es 200 OK o 400 si no hay más pistas\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 400]);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.test(\"Valida avance al orden 2 de pistas\", function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(json.data.totalHintsUnlocked).to.eql(2);",
                  "        pm.expect(json.data.unlockedHint.orderIndex).to.eql(2);",
                  "    });",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{authToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/challenges/{{challengeId}}/hints/unlock",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "challenges",
                "{{challengeId}}",
                "hints",
                "unlock"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Desbloquea la segunda pista secuencialmente si está disponible."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Evaluación de Arquitectura (/evaluate)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Evaluar Arquitectura Satisfactoria",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code es 200 OK\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Valida estructura y métricas de evaluación\", function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true;",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property(\"score\");",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property(\"passed\");",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property(\"isNewHighScore\");",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property(\"earnedXP\");",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property(\"currentUserXP\");",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property(\"currentUserLevel\");",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property(\"feedback\");",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property(\"attemptId\");",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{authToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"graph\": {\n    \"components\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"s3-main\",\n        \"serviceCode\": \"AWS_S3\",\n        \"label\": \"Bucket Estáticos\",\n        \"config\": {\n          \"isPublic\": false,\n          \"encryptionEnabled\": true\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"cf-dist\",\n        \"serviceCode\": \"AWS_CLOUDFRONT\",\n        \"label\": \"CDN CloudFront\",\n        \"config\": {}\n      }\n    ],\n    \"connections\": [\n      {\n        \"fromComponentId\": \"cf-dist\",\n        \"toComponentId\": \"s3-main\",\n        \"connectionType\": \"DATA\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/challenges/{{challengeId}}/evaluate",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "challenges",
                "{{challengeId}}",
                "evaluate"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Envía una solución arquitectónica para evaluación en el motor de reglas."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Re-evaluar Misma Solución (Anti-Refarming XP = 0)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code es 200 OK\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Verifica que no se otorga XP redundante (Anti-Refarming)\", function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true;",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.earnedXP).to.eql(0);",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.isNewHighScore).to.be.false;",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{authToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"graph\": {\n    \"components\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"s3-main\",\n        \"serviceCode\": \"AWS_S3\",\n        \"label\": \"Bucket Estáticos\",\n        \"config\": {\n          \"isPublic\": false,\n          \"encryptionEnabled\": true\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"cf-dist\",\n        \"serviceCode\": \"AWS_CLOUDFRONT\",\n        \"label\": \"CDN CloudFront\",\n        \"config\": {}\n      }\n    ],\n    \"connections\": [\n      {\n        \"fromComponentId\": \"cf-dist\",\n        \"toComponentId\": \"s3-main\",\n        \"connectionType\": \"DATA\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/challenges/{{challengeId}}/evaluate",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "challenges",
                "{{challengeId}}",
                "evaluate"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Verifica que el re-envío de la misma solución con igual o menor puntaje resulte en earnedXP: 0."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - Historial de Envíos e Intentos (/attempts)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Obtener Historial de Intentos del Desafío (/attempts)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code es 200 OK\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Valida lista de intentos históricos del usuario\", function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true;",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.be.an(\"array\").that.is.not.empty;",
                  "    ",
                  "    var firstAttempt = json.data[0];",
                  "    pm.expect(firstAttempt).to.have.property(\"id\");",
                  "    pm.expect(firstAttempt).to.have.property(\"score\");",
                  "    pm.expect(firstAttempt).to.have.property(\"passed\");",
                  "    pm.expect(firstAttempt).to.have.property(\"hintsUsed\");",
                  "    pm.expect(firstAttempt).to.have.property(\"createdAt\");",
                  "    pm.expect(firstAttempt).to.have.property(\"graphSubmitted\");",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{authToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/challenges/{{challengeId}}/attempts",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "challenges",
                "{{challengeId}}",
                "attempts"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Obtiene la lista cronológica de intentos y auditoría para el desafío seleccionado."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
